# ── EXPERIMENTO BARBA · brazo D: barba AL RAPE + luz suave (aisla la luz) ─────────────────
# Las tres primeras hipotesis (habla, codificacion, resolucion) dieron todas
# cerca de cero: -1.3%, -1.4%, +4.7%. No falta detalle fino.
#
# Mirando la barba ampliada 3x se ve el problema real: los pelos SI estan, pero
# salen rectos, radiales y separados, como cerdas de cepillo. Un pelo real se
# apelmaza en mechones irregulares. Eso es lo "acartonado".
#
# Y lo pide mi propio prompt: "close-cropped" (al rape = cerdoso) y una luz dura
# y rasante, que es lo que mas marca cada pelo suelto. Aqui cambian SOLO esas
# dos cosas; misma semilla, misma resolucion, mismos pasos.
@TIPO habla
@ESCENA A man of about fifty-five with short grey-flecked dark hair, a close-cropped salt-and-pepper beard, deep-set brown eyes with pronounced creases at the corners and a narrow mouth, wearing a charcoal grey wool sweater. Tight close-up: his face fills the frame from forehead to chin. A large soft diffused key light from the left wraps gently around his face, with soft gradual shadow on the right side, no hard edges. He is seated against a plain matte black studio backdrop that fills the entire frame behind him. Static locked-off camera, fine film grain.
@AMBIENTE A very quiet neutral room tone with no identifiable sounds.
@MUSICA A single sustained low cello note held quietly and continuously, unchanging throughout.

TOMA|Primero existimos. Despues, con lo que hacemos, decidimos que somos.|inicio|
